n the dough and packed with Oreos and cookies and cream chocolate. ","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/cookies-and-cream-cookies-4.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/cookies-and-cream-cookies-4.jpg","width":1333,"height":2000,"caption":"cookies and cream cookies"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Cookies","item":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/category\/cookies\/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Cookies and Cream Cookies"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/#website","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/","name":"Baran Bakery","description":"always serving love &amp; sugar","publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/#organization"},"potentialAction":[{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/?s={search_term_string}"},"query-input":{"@type":"PropertyValueSpecification","valueRequired":true,"valueName":"search_term_string"}}],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/#organization","name":"Baran Bakery","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/baranbakery_696x696.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/baranbakery_696x696.jpg","width":696,"height":696,"caption":"Baran Bakery"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/"},"sameAs":["https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/baranbakery","https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/baranbakery\/?hl=en","https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/bernicebaran\/","https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/channel\/UCE4FqtV59HdgTql94YR_qfw"]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/#\/schema\/person\/8a899f4b320915b2db45dee7089a63ef","name":"Bernice Baran","sameAs":["https:\/\/www.baranbakery.com\/"]},{"@type":"Recipe","name":"Cookies and Cream Cookies Recipe","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Bernice Baran"},"description":"These are the ULTIMATE cookies and cream cookies with Oreo cookie crumbs in the cookie dough and packed full of chopped Oreos and Hershey’s cookies and cream chocolates. ","datePublished":"2021-11-29T22:17:00+00:00","image":["https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/cookies-and-cream-cookies-4.jpg"],"recipeYield":["8","8 small cookies"],"prepTime":"PT5M","cookTime":"PT10M","totalTime":"PT20M","recipeIngredient":["56 grams salted butter (melted)","135 grams light brown sugar (packed)","1  large egg (room temperature)","1 tsp vanilla extract","120 grams all-purpose flour (spooned and leveled)","25 grams oreo crumbs","1\/4 tsp fine sea salt","1 tsp baking powder","5  Oreo cookies (roughly chopped)","85 grams Hershey&#39;s Cookies and Cream Chocolate (or white chocolate chips)","sea salt flakes"],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Preheat the oven to 350F (177C) convection OR 325F (163C) conventional and line two cookie sheets with parchment paper.","name":"Preheat the oven to 350F (177C) convection OR 325F (163C) conventional and line two cookie sheets with parchment paper.","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#wprm-recipe-9765-step-0-0"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"In a medium bowl, microwave the butter for 20-30 seconds, just until it&#x27;s melted (if it gets super hot, then let it cool a little bit).","name":"In a medium bowl, microwave the butter for 20-30 seconds, just until it&#x27;s melted (if it gets super hot, then let it cool a little bit).","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#wprm-recipe-9765-step-0-1"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Add the light brown sugar to the melted butter and whisk together for about a minute. Add in the egg and vanilla and whisk until it&#x27;s completely smooth.","name":"Add the light brown sugar to the melted butter and whisk together for about a minute. Add in the egg and vanilla and whisk until it&#x27;s completely smooth.","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#wprm-recipe-9765-step-0-2"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Add the flour, Oreo crumbs, salt and baking powder and fold the cookie dough just until there are a few streaks left of flour.","name":"Add the flour, Oreo crumbs, salt and baking powder and fold the cookie dough just until there are a few streaks left of flour.","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#wprm-recipe-9765-step-0-3"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Fold in the chopped Oreos and white chocolate, just until they&#x27;re evenly dispersed.","name":"Fold in the chopped Oreos and white chocolate, just until they&#x27;re evenly dispersed.","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#wprm-recipe-9765-step-0-4"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Split cookie dough into 8 small cookies, four per cookie sheet, and bake one sheet on the middle rack for 10 minutes on convection or 12 minutes on conventional, just until the edges are starting to brown and the center is puffed.","name":"Split cookie dough into 8 small cookies, four per cookie sheet, and bake one sheet on the middle rack for 10 minutes on convection or 12 minutes on conventional, just until the edges are starting to brown and the center is puffed.","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#wprm-recipe-9765-step-0-5"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Remove them from the oven, give the pan a quick tap on the counter and allow them to rest for 5-10 minutes before transferring off the cookie sheet.","name":"Remove them from the oven, give the pan a quick tap on the counter and allow them to rest for 5-10 minutes before transferring off the cookie sheet.","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#wprm-recipe-9765-step-0-6"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Sprinkle with sea salt flakes and enjoy warm!","name":"Sprinkle with sea salt flakes and enjoy warm!","url":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#wprm-recipe-9765-step-0-7"}],"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":"4.79","ratingCount":"19"},"recipeCategory":["Cookies"],"recipeCuisine":["American"],"keywords":"cookies, cookies and cream cookies, oreo chocolate chip cookies, oreo cookies, quick and easy cookies, small batch cookies, white chocolate chip cookies","nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation","servingSize":"1 g","calories":"285 kcal","carbohydrateContent":"41 g","proteinContent":"4 g","fatContent":"12 g","saturatedFatContent":"7 g","cholesterolContent":"41 mg","sodiumContent":"164 mg","fiberContent":"1 g","sugarContent":"25 g","unsaturatedFatContent":"4 g"},"@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#recipe","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/#article"},"mainEntityOfPage":"https:\/\/baranbakery.com\/cookies-and-cream-cookies\/"}]}</script>
