<div style="font-size:17px" class="has-link-color wp-elements-21 wp-block-comment-author-name has-text-color has-warm-brown-color has-ivyora-display-font-family">Adrianne</div>

<div style="font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2.1px" class="has-link-color wp-elements-22 wp-block-comment-date has-text-color has-warm-brown-color has-archivo-font-family"><time datetime="2023-05-29T10:09:53-04:00">29.05.2023</time></div>

<div class="has-link-color wp-elements-23 wp-block-comment-content has-text-color has-warm-brown-color"><p>Instead of Oreos I added Tagalongs because we needed to finish the box and walnuts too. They turned out great!</p>
